## 🎮 Game Description

"Guess the Number" is a simple yet engaging number-guessing game where the player has to guess a randomly generated number between 1 and 100. The player has a limited number of attempts (default: 7) to find the correct number. After each incorrect guess, the game provides a hint — either "Too high" or "Too low". If the player guesses the correct number within the allowed attempts, they win! Otherwise, they lose.

